# Originally generated by ESPHome, kept deliberately and edited.
#
# Both entries are load-bearing - do NOT remove them:
#
#   /.esphome/     build output. Large, machine-specific, regenerated by every build.
#   /secrets.yaml  real WiFi / API / OTA credentials and the diffuser's BLE address.
#                  The tracked template is secrets.yaml.example - edit that one.
#
# The repository-root .gitignore already covers both. This file is kept so the coverage
# travels with the directory, e.g. when esphome/ is copied into a Home Assistant
# ESPHome add-on config folder.
/.esphome/
/secrets.yaml
